# A blank case (user request, 2026-10-26): New case > Blank case makes an empty OpenFOAM case; "A box" gives it a
# blockMeshDict that meshes. Duplicate copies its setup and mesh but not its logs or results.
budget p95 80 max 600
click nav:new case
wait 5
click starter-blank
wait 3
assert modal blank
click blank-name
key a ctrl
type mybox
wait 2
click blank-start#2
wait 2
assert text A 1 m box of 20 x 20 x 20 cells
click blank-create
wait 10
assert page Mesh
assert file system/controlDict
assert file system/blockMeshDict
assert log system/controlDict simpleFoam
action mesh.generate
wait-until job running timeout 20
wait-until job finished timeout 120
assert log log.checkMesh Mesh OK.
assert log constant/polyMesh/boundary inlet
note duplicate: setup and mesh, no logs
action case.duplicate
wait 10
assert file $SB/ws/mybox-copy/system/blockMeshDict
assert file $SB/ws/mybox-copy/constant/polyMesh/boundary
assert not file $SB/ws/mybox-copy/log.checkMesh
note the palette's way in, and a transient one that starts at the STL mesher
action case.blank
wait 3
assert modal blank
click blank-app#1
click blank-start#0
wait 2
click blank-create
wait 10
assert file $SB/ws/case/system/controlDict
assert log $SB/ws/case/system/controlDict pimpleFoam
assert text Start with the part
